  "description": "School is a class society. Classes are sharply divided into power, appearance, money, and family.  \nHowever, as the unknown virus spread, the strong fell and the children who maintained the ordinary became the strong. \"In a reversed class society, I became the top 1%.\"\n\n**Original Webtoon:**  \n[Naver Webtoon](https://comic.naver.com/webtoon/list?titleId=783256), [Naver Series](https://series.naver.com/comic/detail.series?productNo=6685080)\n\n**Official Translations:**  \n[S.Chinese](https://www.dongmanmanhua.cn/BOY/dingjian1/list?title_no=2006), [Indonesian](https://www.webtoons.com/id/drama/the-top-1-percent/list?title_no=8427)",
